# Cancelling the start date prompt opened from the command menu returns to editing at the same caret column.
file <<END
- Dentist
END
see Dentist
keys <Enter> <Left> <Left> /
type set start
keys <Enter>
see Start date
keys <Esc>
hide Start date
status EDIT
type Q
keys <Esc>
quit
saved <<END
- DentiQst
END
